"""Runs before tests/conftest.py imports the app: marks this process as a test run.

The worker's broker is picked when `worker/broker.py` is first imported
(tasks register on it as they are defined), from ENVIRONMENT. Set here, before
any test imports the app, the tests get the in-memory broker, which runs each
task as it is sent: no RabbitMQ or Redis needed.
"""

import os

os.environ["ENVIRONMENT"] = "test"
